          "title": "You'll want to know: ಬಂಧಿಸು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಂಧಿಸು — bandhisu — \"to arrest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೊಲೀಸರು ಕಳ್ಳನನ್ನು ಬೆಳಗ್ಗೆ ಬಂಧಿಸಿದರು. polīsaru kaḷḷanannu beḷagge bandhisidaru. The police arrested the thief in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಬಂಧಿಸಿದೆ, bandhiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person arrested takes -ಅನ್ನು: ಕಳ್ಳನನ್ನು ಬಂಧಿಸು (bandhisu)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಂಧಿಸು (bandhisu) is built on Sanskrit bandha, \"a bond\", and also \"custody\" (CDIAL 9136), from the root bandh, \"to bind\", with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
