          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತನಿಖೆ — tanikhe — \"an investigation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೊಲೀಸರು ಆ ಘಟನೆಯ ತನಿಖೆ ಶುರು ಮಾಡಿದರು. polīsaru ā ghaṭaneya tanikhe śuru māḍidaru. The police began an investigation into that incident."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತನಿಖೆ (tanikhe) ಮಾಡು, to investigate. What is investigated takes the possessive -ಅ: ಘಟನೆಯ ತನಿಖೆ (tanikhe)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತನಿಖೆ (tanikhe) is usually traced to Hindustani tanqīh, \"an inquiry, an investigation\", a word of Arabic origin; the path into Kannada is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
